OL,3,GNEWSAKnife-sniffing dog back for
OL,4,Aweapons crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the country's only specialist
OL,7,Fknife detection dogs is returning to a
OL,8,Fcounty for a week-long police operation
OL,9,Ftargeting knife crime.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police called on the
OL,12,Fhelp of Gunner last month, when the
OL,13,Fdog's sensitive snout sniffed out two
OL,14,Ffolding knives and a screwdriver from a
OL,15,Fpark in Rushden.
OL,17,FGunner, a German shorthaired pointer,
OL,18,Fis one of a small number of knife
OL,19,Fdetection dogs nationally and is
OL,20,Ftrained to identify a specific scent
OL,21,Fleft on metal objects after contact
OL,22,Fwith human skin.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
