OL,3,GNEWSAKnife-sniffing dog back for
OL,4,Aweapons crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week he is back as the force joins
OL,7,Fa national week of action focusing on
OL,8,Feducation and enforcement around knife
OL,9,Fcrime.
